Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a dba combination on the full pool to see if it beats the current mean pool1 leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool_full","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on the high‑quality pool1 using inverse error weights to see if it improves over the mean‑pool1 leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["THETA","rf","catboost","CWT_catboost","FT_catboost"],"weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on the full pool using inverse error weighting to see if it beats the current weighted pool4 result.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on the high‑quality pool1 using inverse error weights to see if it can beat the current weighted pool4 leader.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on pool2 using inverse_error to see if the larger pool improves over pool1.

Action: evaluate_strategy

